 'salary-increase':['$25 an hour raised to $28 an hour, 40 hours a week, 52 weeks',[['1. Dollar change','$28 − $25','$3 an hour'],['2. Percent change','$3 ÷ $25 × 100','12%'],['3. Annual change','$3 × 40 × 52','$6,240 a year']],'12% raise — $6,240 a year','Uses your entered schedule. Percent alone can mislead: compare the dollar change too.'],
